name wordnet-sentidx
# wndb.5: "Each line of the file sentidx.vrb contains a sense_key followed by a space and a comma separated list of
# example sentence template numbers, in decimal."
# wndb.5 names the first field sense_key and gives the list no name: each claim is a pair, the sense_key and a
# template number. One line (pet%2:35:00::) lists none.
# The sense_key is recorded whole (see index.sense).
# The names after "columns" are this recipe's handles for the fields; they are never recorded.
match sentidx.vrb
grammar table
separator space
columns sense_key templates
list templates ,

claims
pair
subject in sense_key
object in templates
